  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Sandy Magnolia, a beautifully remodeled coastal retreat located in the sought-after Eastern Lake community along Scenic 30A. Perfectly positioned just minutes from the sugar-white sands and emerald waters of the Gulf, this spacious home offers effortless access to the beach, Eastern Lake, shopping, dining, and all the best of Seagrove Beach.<br>Designed with comfort, style, and entertaining in mind, this two-story home comfortably sleeps up to 16 guests, making it ideal for large families or groups of friends seeking a memorable beach getaway.<br>✨ Backyard Oasis<br>Step outside to your private outdoor paradise, perfect for both relaxation and fun:<br>Private swimming pool with ambient evening lighting<br>Built-in grills for cookouts<br>Picnic table for casual outdoor dining<br>Gas fire pit with seating for six<br>Sand pit area for games and family fun<br>🚲 Bonus Amenities<br>6-seat golf cart for cruising 30A<br>9 assorted bikes for easy exploration<br>Ping pong table for friendly competition<br>🏡 Home Layout & Features<br>First Floor<br>Cozy living room with large TV and expansive glass doors opening to the backyard oasis<br>Mini bar / kitchenette with toaster oven, wine cooler, and coffee maker<br>Bunk room with twin-over-Queen bunk beds and ensuite bathroom<br>King bedroom with ensuite bathroom featuring a luxurious two-person walk-in shower and direct access to the patio and pool<br>Second Floor<br>Fully equipped chef's kitchen with top-of-the-line appliances<br>Large island with seating for 4<br>Breakfast nook with seating for 4<br>Spacious dining table with seating for 10<br>Breakfast dining with seating for 6<br>Bright, open living room with TV and faux fireplace<br>Wrap-around porch and abundant natural light<br>Sleeping Arrangements Upstairs:<br>King bedroom with ensuite bathroom<br>Bunk room with two twin-over-full bunk beds<br>Queen bedroom with adjoining bathroom<br>Laundry room with full-size washer and dryer<br><br>The Perfect 30A Location<br>Located in the heart of Seagrove, Sandy Magnolia offers the best of both worlds—peaceful surroundings with close proximity to:<br>Pristine beach access<br>Eastern Lake<br>Boutique shopping<br>Local dining favorites<br>Scenic bike paths along 30A<br><br>⭐ Why You'll Love Sandy Magnolia<br>Recently fully remodeled<br>Sleeps 16 comfortably<br>Private pool + outdoor entertainment space<br>Golf cart & bikes included<br>Ideal for families and group vacations<br>Prime Eastern Lake / Seagrove location<br>Everything you need for a perfect beach vacation is right here.<br>Come unwind, explore, and make unforgettable memories at Sunrise and Serenity 🌞🌊<br><br>📍 Area Attractions Near Sandy Magnolia<br>🌴 Things To Do<br>Eastern Lake – One of 30A's rare coastal dune lakes, perfect for paddleboarding, kayaking, and peaceful sunset views<br>Beach Days on 30A – Enjoy soft white sand and emerald Gulf waters just minutes away<br>Bike the 30A Path – Scenic paved trail connecting Seagrove, Seaside, WaterColor, Grayton Beach, and beyond<br>Golf Cart Cruising – Easy access to nearby beaches, restaurants, and shops<br>Paddleboarding & Kayaking – Rentals available throughout Seagrove and Seaside<br>Fishing & Charter Boats – Gulf and bay fishing excursions nearby<br>Seaside Farmers Market – Seasonal market with local goods, food, and art<br>Live Music & Events – Frequent outdoor concerts and festivals along 30A<br>🍽️ Nearby Restaurants<br>Old Florida Fish House – Waterfront dining overlooking Eastern Lake<br>Cafe Thirty-A – Upscale coastal cuisine and cocktails<br>The Perfect Pig – Popular spot for breakfast, brunch, and lunch<br>Surfing Deer – Refined Southern cuisine with a modern twist<br>Angelina's Pizzeria – Italian favorites and family-friendly atmosphere<br>Bud & Alley's (Seaside) – Iconic Gulf views and fresh seafood<br>Great Southern Café (Seaside) – Southern comfort food and live music<br>Seagrove Village Market Café – Casual bites and beach-day essentials<br>🛍️ Shopping<br>Seaside Town Center – Boutique shopping, art galleries, and unique coastal finds<br>30Avenue – Upscale shops, dining, and entertainment<br>Shops of Grayton – Local boutiques, coffee shops, and laid-back vibes<br>WaterColor Crossings – Charming retail and dining options<br>Grand Boulevard at Sandestin – Larger shopping destination with restaurants and entertainment<br>🌿 State Parks & Nature<br>Grayton Beach State Park – Pristine beaches, hiking trails, and coastal dune lakes<br>Deer Lake State Park – Elevated boardwalks, rare dune ecosystem, and scenic views<br>Topsail Hill Preserve State Park – Miles of trails, lakes, and secluded beaches<br>Point Washington State Forest – Hiking, biking, and wildlife viewing",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Backyard Oasis, Pool,Sandy Magnolia, Sleeps 16,Eastern Lake,Golf Cart, Bikes"
        }
      ],
